Gaspar Caetano is a gaunt, pale dhampir with sharp fangs and deep, dark circles beneath his eyes, wearing a heavy leather coat lined with formaldehyde-scented specimen pouches.

Gaspar is a member of [[Org/NecroLog/index|NecroLog]]. He keeps the Org’s black, gothic [[Phenomena/Hearts|Heart]] aboard the [[Org/The Harlequins/Providence|Providence]], admits no visitors, and turns callers away, saying that meetings are arranged through the [[Org/Pale Lantern Society/index|Pale Lantern Society]].
